      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "api_symbol",
      "contextBefore": "For possible values, see [`CFStringTokenizerTokenType`](cfstringtokenizertokentype.md).",
      "contextAfter": "If there is no preceding call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md), the function finds the first token in the range specified by the [`CFStringTokenizerCreate(_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizercreate(_:_:_:_:_:).md).",
