    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If there is no preceding call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md), the function finds the first token in the range specified by the [`CFStringTokenizerCreate(_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizercreate(_:_:_:_:_:).md).",
      "normalizedSource": "If there is no preceding call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md), the function finds the first token in the range specified by the [`CFStringTokenizerCreate(_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizercreate(_:_:_:_:_:).md).",
      "sourceHash": "46c4f47a40470d359908ac102ed7a062ea8ee4a7f8798ffde309974117723c20",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "If there is a preceding, successful, call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md) and there is a current token, proceeds to the next token.",
      "documentTitle": "CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(:)",
      "framework": "CoreFoundation",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If there is a preceding, successful, call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md) and there is a current token, proceeds to the next token.",
      "normalizedSource": "If there is a preceding, successful, call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md) and there is a current token, proceeds to the next token.",
      "sourceHash": "f1702c68b7758e791181dc9d6a9150acaf5d5b2fab31dce0a69e52708ae86858",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If there is no preceding call to [`CFStringTokenizerGoToTokenAtIndex(_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizergototokenatindex(_:_:).md) or [`CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(_:)`](cfstringtokenizeradvancetonexttoken(_:).md), the function finds the first token in the range specified by the [`CFStringTokenizerCreate(_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfstringtokenizercreate(_:_:_:_:_:).md).",
      "contextAfter": "If a token is found, it is set as the current token and the function returns `true`; otherwise the current token is invalidated and the function returns `false`.",
      "documentTitle": "CFStringTokenizerAdvanceToNextToken(:)",
      "framework": "CoreFoundation",
      "ko": "",
